# (each LUKS header holds a Tang binding, the passphrase slot stays as a fallback).
# _netdev hangs them off remote-cryptsetup.target; nofail keeps boot and SSH from
# waiting on them, the mounts, NFS and Garage wait instead (see the mount units).
# <name>  <device>                                    <key>  <options>
